PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Manifold Patch
  L2: Closed Loop
    - Smooth loop based at p
    - 6px stroke, green (#00FF00FF)
  L3: Vector Transport
    - Initial vector v at p
    - Transported vector after loop: v'
    - v' rotated relative to v
    - Use red (#FF0000FF) for v'
  L4: Labels
    - "p" at base point
    - "Holonomy" near loop
    - "v" and "v'" labeled
  L5: Annotation Overlay
    - Equation: "Hol(p): v ↦ v'"

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
